WEBVTT

00:17:29.211 --> 00:17:33.215
a man who believed that connection
equals compassion.

00:17:34.341 --> 00:17:36.718
So I'm not going to leave you
with an answer.

00:17:37.552 --> 00:17:39.888
I'm going to leave you with a question.

00:17:41.139 --> 00:17:42.849
Are we to be bystanders,

00:17:42.891 --> 00:17:46.186
like moths dancing
around somebody else’s flame?

00:17:46.228 --> 00:17:48.480
Or are we to be upstanders,

00:17:48.522 --> 00:17:52.442
and we light darkness ourselves
with our own torch of compassion?

00:17:52.442 --> 00:17:54.653
Because when there is light,

00:17:54.694 --> 00:17:59.074
we see each other not as strangers,

00:17:59.116 --> 00:18:00.867
not as opponents